x02003;Under 20</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">3 (3.1)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">3 (3.0)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.12 (0.22&#x02013;5.78)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.85 (0.15&#x02013;4.95)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;20&#x02013;39</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">12 (4.6)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">6 (2.3)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2.02 (0.74&#x02013;5.49)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2.15 (0.72&#x02013;6.44)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;40 or over</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">12 (6.0)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">8 (3.6)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.69 (0.68&#x02013;4.23)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.30 (0.49&#x02013;3.48)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;All ages</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">27 (4.8)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">17 (2.9)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.72 (0.93&#x02013;3.20)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.48 (0.77&#x02013;2.86)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote9"><label/><p>HPV=human papillomavirus; OR=odds ratio; CI=confidence interval.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote10"><label>a</label><p>For cases <italic>vs</italic> controls (logistic regression).</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote11"><label>b</label><p>Adjusted for age in years.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote12"><label>c</label><p>Adjusted for age in years, infection with other specific HPV type (16 or 18) and infection with unknown HPV type (positive using GP5&#x0002b;/6&#x0002b; primers but negative for HPV 16/18).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>